            "description_html": "<b>RK International CP-3709, Rope Bail Pull with Floral Ends</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Twist Bail Cabinet Pull with Flower Mounts has a romantic feel. The floral mounts are great for adding the perfect finishing touch to any space. This pull has a 3 inch center to center and is available in 5 finishes. Comes packaged with mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CP-3709 Traditional Twisted Pull with Flower Mounts:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-G55G1_size.gif?v=1704354738\" width=\"600\" height=\"146\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
